## Proposed Fix

Add a config path to `models.providers.*` (and optionally `models.providers.*.models.*`) that flows into `resolveTranscriptPolicy()`.

### Option A: Provider-level config

```json
{
  "models": {
    "providers": {
      "my-provider": {
        "api": "openai-completions",
        "transcriptPolicy": {
          "dropReasoningFromHistory": false
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

